  destruct ((GF VAKU.g_pfacts) _ _ _ _ _ _ BIx) as ((PF1 & PF2 & PF3 & PF4 & _) & (FD & FW & FSW & FLU & FLW) & (PL1 & PL2 & PL3 & PL4) & (SW & OWNV & PS1 & PS2 & PS3 & PS4) & (CSB & CUAR & IMGC) & (AVSH & AVF & AVS));
  change (ff_bytes 1) with 128 in *; change (128 / 8) with 16 in *.

